item SWORD TOOLS HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Sword
detail SWORD The first tool. Swings, and the down-thrust bounce.
item BLASTER TOOLS HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Blaster
detail BLASTER The second tool. Bolts that knock critters back.
item PICK TOOLS HAND EQUIP,INSPECT Pick
detail PICK The third tool. Hold on a cube to mine it; aim to place one.
item RECRUIT ARMOR BODY EQUIP,INSPECT Recruit Plate
detail RECRUIT Tier 0. What you woke up in.
item SCOUT ARMOR BODY EQUIP,INSPECT Scout Plate
detail SCOUT Tier 1. A shield core folded into the chest.
item VANGUARD ARMOR BODY EQUIP,INSPECT Vanguard Plate
detail VANGUARD Tier 2. Two cores. The shoulders glow.
item PARAGON ARMOR BODY EQUIP,INSPECT Paragon Plate
detail PARAGON Tier 3. Three cores. Nothing more to add.
item GRASS CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Grass Cube
detail GRASS Mined from the meadow. Places as turf.
item DIRT CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Dirt Cube
detail DIRT Under the grass. Quick to mine.
item STONE CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Stone Cube
detail STONE Slow to mine. Holds a wall up.
item WOOD CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Wood Cube
detail WOOD From the trunks. Burns, floats.
item ORE CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Ore Cube
detail ORE Glints in the dark. The smiths of other realms want it.
item SAND CUBES - PLACE,DROP,SPLIT Sand Cube
detail SAND Falls when nothing holds it.
item GATE_KEY KEYS - INSPECT Gate Key
detail GATE_KEY Opens one of the three rainbow gates off World Zero.
item ZEE_BRUSH WARES - INSPECT Gallery Brush
detail ZEE_BRUSH Zee's stock after the galleries: a curator's brush, bristles still blue.
item ZEE_HONEY WARES - INSPECT Parcels Honey
detail ZEE_HONEY A jar from Beekeeper Hollis's hives, by way of Zee's cart.
item ZEE_STUD WARES - INSPECT Brick Stud
detail ZEE_STUD One stud, sorted by colour by the Builder Kids' Club. Twice.
item ZEE_CHALK WARES - INSPECT Labyrinth Chalk
detail ZEE_CHALK A stick of route chalk. Marks fade when the maze folds.
